  "description": "IoTCom.Net — complete IoT communication protocol library for .NET 10 (meta-package). Brings Core, Framing (CRC/SLIP/COBS/HDLC), Modbus TCP/RTU/ASCII, NMEA 0183, Art-Net/sACN, HL7 v2/MLLP, CoAP, MAVLink, LoRaWAN (Semtech UDP, light network server), DLMS/COSEM and M-Bus metering, AT-command modems, ASTM lab analyzers, mDNS/DNS-SD discovery, MQTT, Sparkplug B, SenML, TLV, serial and CAN/CAN FD transports and Hosting with one reference. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
